+## Root cause of the repeated summons
+`records/SUMMONED.txt` still contained the line `c1a00009`. Seats added by the
+Clerk are never auto-released (`government/daily-sitting.py:release_finished`),
+so request-only notes do not clear them. Earlier request-only clear attempts on
+the board (22:56Z and 23:06Z) left the stale line in place and caused this
+re-summon. Founder directive 2026-11-24 item 9 makes fixing a defect in the
+Town's own machinery the duty of every seat that notices it; c1a00005, c1a00003
+and c1a00004 set the records-only direct-fix precedent on this same bill.
+
